<title>USA: First Northern Capital Corp Q4 oper up.</title>
<headline>First Northern Capital Corp Q4 oper up.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Oper Shr	  $0.30		    $0.25</p>
<p> Oper Net	  1,370		    1,169</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper Shr	  $1.09		    $0.91</p>
<p> Oper Net	  4,982		    4,199</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating earnings above exclude a one-time charge for SAIF of $1.73 million after-tax or $0.39 a share in the third quarter, less the reduction of $34,000 for the deposit insurance premium in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Including the charge in 1996 and other one-time items in 1995, the company reported net income for 1996 of $3.28 million or $0.72 a share versus $4.59 million or $0.99 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
